flowchart TB
  T["THETA - 9:16 FRAME LAYOUT MAP<br/>The on-screen grid every shot is composed against.<br/>Same zones power the video AND the in-app coach UI<br/>(DESIGN 3b) - one visual language, two surfaces."]:::brand

  T --> Z1
  Z1["ZONE A - TOP SAFE (0 to 12% height)<br/>Status / lesson chip: 'L5 - THETA' in mono.<br/>Tiny watching-coach avatar lives here during<br/>the teaching middle. Never put key art here."]:::spec
  Z1 --> Z2
  Z2["ZONE B - STAGE (12 to 62% height) - the hero band<br/>Cold open: the ancient scene + chibi coach.<br/>Teaching: the hook art / interactive control.<br/>Scanner: the live card. This zone carries meaning.<br/>Camera push-ins are framed on this band."]:::nova
  Z2 --> Z3
  Z3["ZONE C - MESSAGE (62 to 82% height)<br/>IBM Plex Mono, signal green on navy.<br/>Coach text types on with a blinking cursor.<br/>Max 2 lines - terminal voice, never a paragraph."]:::shot
  Z3 --> Z4
  Z4["ZONE D - ACTION / BOTTOM SAFE (82 to 100%)<br/>Interactive control (slider/toggle/two-door) OR<br/>the CTA button. Thumb-reachable by design -<br/>the video mirrors where the app's tap target is."]:::spec

  Z4 --> R
  R["READING ORDER PER SHOT<br/>Eye lands Stage (B) -> reads Message (C) -><br/>acts in Action (D). Chip (A) is glanceable only.<br/>Hold this and every shot composes itself."]:::brand

  R --> M
  M["MOTION RULES (App Store polish)<br/>- Only ONE zone animates as the focus at a time.<br/>- Coach text never moves while user is meant to act.<br/>- Buzz = the single permitted hard cut + light streak.<br/>- Logo end card uses Zone B center, everything else clears."]:::spec

